# The parity table of System Details and Logs: origin/main's two read-only screens and -p against
# the screens that replace them (refactor plan §2, slice 1's unit (c), next/s1-screen;
# docs/engine/parity-system-details.md).
# Generated by TestParity (pkg/screens/systemdetails); make golden-update rewrites it. Do not edit.
# origin/main: pkg/characterization's goldens, read in place: menu/system_details_*, menu/logs_*.
# The new path: the screens' Run on detect's facts through details.Bounded, typed as each cell's
# "new path:" line says, and logs.Print for -p, on hostfake: written, not run (gate 5). A row is what
# the screen drew, beside the fact on a twin host where origin/main's form holds figures it rounds.
# Sources: decision <n> gallery-system-details.md §5, its Made here calls, §6 its words (adopted
# 2026-10-30); defect <n> and the slice's Logs dump and Broken log parser, its §7; readers §9,
# readers-system-details.md's words (adopted 2026-10-30), and §12 decision <n>, its engineering, not
# adopted, which says so; KNOWN-DEFECT, a line of the cell's golden; P-18 (decided).

